      "en": "Turkish defense electronics and armaments prime Aselsan unveiled a scaled-up 20-missile configuration of its GÖKSUR Point Defense Missile System (PDMS), designated GÖKSUR 100-N, at Euronaval 2026. Featuring an automated stabilized turret equipped with the BOZDOĞAN-DH imaging infrared (IIR) guided interceptor missile, the GÖKSUR 100-N provides 360-degree point defense for surface vessels against anti-ship cruise missiles, UAV swarms, combat aircraft, and helicopters at ranges up to 15 km.",
