      "en": "Resolving the 30 Oct US Department of Defense contract announcements (when war.gov was unreachable in the cloud run), Naval Air Systems Command (NAVAIR) awarded Bell Textron Inc. a USD 114.7M contract modification (P00001 to N0001926C0140) exercising an option for H-1 structural and electrical power improvements under Next-Gen Effects Phase III, covering 15 A-kits, four mission kits, and nine aircraft installations for US Marine Corps AH-1Z Viper and UH-1Y Venom helicopters through June 2028.",
