      "HIGH PRIORITY — Adversary missile test: North Korea tested a 'Standard Type 2' scatterable cluster-munition warhead on a tactical ballistic missile (assessed as a wheeled-TEL KN-24) over the West Sea on 31 Oct and vowed to field four cluster warhead variants to military units before year-end 2026 (C1).",
